## Limitations

The short version: the data is synthetic; the rectification windows D3/D10 are simplified analogues of MEL repair-interval categories B and C, not operator MEL decisions; grounded aircraft keep accruing flying exposure; the repair shop queue is light by construction; brake cost-per-landing contracts are not modelled; the AOG cost is a scenario value; the optimiser is a greedy heuristic; and every policy, the legacy one included, depends on the AOG recovery routes: {{RESULT:honest.routes_off}}. The full, specific list is in [LIMITATIONS.md](LIMITATIONS.md).

